        {
          "text": "Abo bazorwanya Umwagazi w’Intama, uwo Mwagazi azobanesha, kukw ari we aganza abaganza n’Umwami w’abami, kand’ abari kumwe na we, bāhamagawe, bātoranijwe, bāyobotse, na bo bazobanesha.",
